@startuml
title Demo: utveksling av laboratorieresultat

actor "Laboratoriesystem" as Lab
participant "FHIR-tjener" as Server
actor "Konsument" as Consumer

Lab -> Server: Opprett Patient (Pasient-1)
Lab -> Server: Opprett Observation (Hemoglobin-1)
note right of Server
    Observation.subject peker på Patient.
end note
Consumer -> Server: Hent laboratorieresultat
Server --> Consumer: Observation med pasientreferanse

@enduml